/* Messages of the Advanced Find engine (Sources/Find), shown by the find panel and the multiple replacement window. */

/* A plain-text or regular expression find string has nothing to find. */
"The find string is empty." = "検索文字列が空です。";

/* Searching in the selection while nothing is selected. */
"There is no selection to search in." = "検索する選択範囲がありません。";

/* A multiple replacement definition (CotEditor .cotrpl) lacks its rules or its settings. */
"The replacement definition has no replacements or settings." = "置換定義に規則も設定もありません。";

/* A rule of a multiple replacement definition is not valid. */
"A replacement of the definition is not valid." = "置換定義に無効な規則があります。";

/* The settings of a multiple replacement definition are not valid. */
"The settings of the replacement definition are not valid." = "置換定義の設定が無効です。";

/* Cheat sheet, differences from OgreKit: \d, \w, \s and \b have their Unicode meaning in ICU. */
"Unicode: also full-width digits, kanji, kana and the full-width space." = "Unicodeの意味で、全角数字・漢字・かな・全角空白にも一致します。";

/* Cheat sheet, differences from OgreKit. “Always capture” is an option of the OgreKit find panel. */
"Named groups are numbered too, as with OgreKit's “Always capture” on." = "名前付きグループにも番号が付きます（OgreKitの「常に捕獲」オンと同じ）。";

/* Cheat sheet and find field, differences from OgreKit: a brace by itself is an error in ICU. */
"ICU needs \\{ and \\} for literal braces (OgreKit did not)." = "ICUでは、{ と } を文字として書くときは \\{ \\} とします（OgreKitではそのままでよかった）。";

/* Cheat sheet and find field, differences from OgreKit. */
"In ICU \\h is a horizontal space; in OgreKit it was a hexadecimal digit. For a digit, write [0-9a-fA-F]." = "ICUの \\h は横方向の空白です（OgreKitでは16進数字）。数字には [0-9a-fA-F] と書きます。";

/* Cheat sheet and find field, differences from OgreKit. */
"In ICU (?m) makes ^ and $ match at each line; in OgreKit it made . match line breaks, which is (?s) in ICU." = "ICUの (?m) は ^ と $ を各行に一致させます（OgreKitでは「.」を改行に一致させた。ICUではそれは (?s)）。";

/* Cheat sheet and find field, differences from OgreKit. */
"In ICU {n}+ is possessive; in OgreKit it repeated the repetition." = "ICUの {n}+ は強欲な繰り返しです（OgreKitでは繰り返しをさらに繰り返した）。";

/* Cheat sheet and find field, differences from OgreKit. */
"ICU has no \\K. Write the part before it as a look-behind (?<=…)." = "ICUには \\K がありません。その前の部分を後読み (?<=…) で書きます。";

/* Cheat sheet and find field, differences from OgreKit. */
"ICU cannot call a group with \\g<name>. Repeat the group's pattern instead." = "ICUでは \\g<名前> でグループを呼び出せません。グループのパターンを書き直します。";

/* Cheat sheet and find field, differences from OgreKit. */
"ICU has no absent operator (?~…)." = "ICUには不在演算子 (?~…) がありません。";

/* Cheat sheet, differences from OgreKit: OgreKit's \p{^…} is an error in ICU. */
"Write \\P{…} in ICU." = "ICUでは \\P{…} と書きます。";
